# TRUSTLAYER — COMPLETE SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE AND INTELLIGENCE ENGINE

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a principal software architect, senior full-stack engineer, supply-chain systems engineer, database architect, and AI-assisted reconciliation specialist.

You are working on an existing application called TrustLayer.

Your task is to understand the attached system architecture reference image and implement the intended functionality within the existing application.

Do not treat this as a request to build a simple invoice management dashboard.

TrustLayer is intended to become an intelligent supply-chain verification and reconciliation layer connecting brands, distributors, wholesalers, suppliers, retailers, and marketplace-facing businesses.

The initial version focuses on invoice verification, inventory reconciliation, transaction relationships, and evidence-based decisions.

Payment processing, payment-method verification, and financial settlement are NOT part of the current version.

Future expansion must remain possible without implementing those features now.

