An invoice may contain multiple product line items.

Do not assume every invoice contains only one product.

When an issued invoice is created, record the invoice accurately, but do not automatically treat the transaction as approved or deduct stock unless the applicable rules permit it.

The issuer's stock must not be reduced twice if the same transaction is edited, resubmitted, or processed again.

